            <h1 class="text-[64px] leading-[60px] md:text-8xl md:leading-[90px] font-serif text-left mb-6 md:mb-2">
                Illuminate            </h1>
                            <div>
                    <a href="https://sabg.ticketapp.org/portal/pid/3/product/975"
                        target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"                         class="bg-water text-primary rounded-full font-bold text-center px-4 py-2 text-md lg:w-auto whitespace-nowrap">
                        Buy Tickets                    </a>
                </div>
                    </div>


        <!-- Hero Image -->
                    <div class="relative w-full min-h-[280px] lg:min-h-[460px] bg-cover bg-center rounded-lg mb-4"
                style="background-image:url('https://sabgtx.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/web-hero-illuminate.png');">
            </div>
        
        <!-- Details and Description -->
        <div class="w-full flex flex-col mb-4 md:flex-row-reverse md:gap-6 md:pt-4 lg:pt-6 lg:gap-12 lg:justify-between">
            <div class="w-full md:w-1/2 md:basis-1/2 lg:flex lg:justify-end lg:items-start">
                <div class="bg-secondary w-full p-6 py-8 mb-6 flex flex-col gap-2 rounded-lg lg:max-w-[525px]"> <!-- Info -->

                    
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-[80px_1fr] gap-4 items-start">
                            <div class="text-base text-dark">Location</div>
                            <div class="text-base font-bold text-dark wrap-break-word">
                                San Antonio Botanical Garden 555 Funston Place, San Antonio, TX
                            </div>
                        </div>

                    
                                            <div class="mt-4 mb-2 space-y-4">
                                                            <a href="https://sabg.ticketapp.org/portal/pid/3/product/975"
                                    class="cta-dark text-[20px] flex items-center text-base font-bold text-dark hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity group">
                                    Buy Tickets                                </a>
                                                    </div>
                                    </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 md:w-1/2 md:basis-1/2 lg:gap-6 2xl:max-w-[600px]"> <!-- Description -->
                <h2 class="font-sans font-bold text-2xl lg:text-4xl">Event Details</h2>
                                                    <div>
                        <p>Illuminate, Presented by H-E-B, returns to the San Antonio Botanical Garden for its third year! Experience the Garden after dark as it transforms into a glowing nighttime adventure filled with light, color, and larger-than-life displays.</p>

<p>Perfect for a family night out, a romantic date night, or festive gatherings with friends, Illuminate invites the whole family to explore dazzling scenes that blend art, culture, and nature in a one-of-a-kind experience unique to San Antonio. With pricing for kids ages 3-12 and free admission for little ones under 3, it's one of the most memorable family-friendly activities in San Antonio to add to your holiday lineup.</p>

<p>Make Illuminate part of your family's holiday tradition and discover something new with every visit.</p>                    </div>
                            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

