					NEW! Pizza Making: Dough Before the Glow				</span>
								<h3>Select dates | 6 – 7:30 p.m.</h3>
<p>Try a brand new experience before your <em>Illuminate</em> visit! Stretch, top, and bake your own pizza before exploring the lights. The Garden&#8217;s culinary team will guide you through simple, hands-on techniques for making delicious homemade pizza.</p>
<p>Class-only tickets are $45 per person, or bundle the class with <em>Illuminate</em> admission for $62 per person. That&#8217;s up to $25.99 in savings when you bundle.</p>
